review": "Bought the base game, and have already put many hours and unlocked the nightmare mode. Weapons feel unique and fun (Throwing Knives are my favorite) combine that with the dual wielding doggo, and you just feel like a ninja. with EXPLOSIONS. \r\nThis game is one of the first times I have played a Rouge-lite, and have been excited to not know what I'll get or how I can combine weapon and perks. \r\n\r\nA few tips for those that are trying this: \r\n~ Don't sleep on ability spam builds, the bird has a way of scaling his ability damage to insane numbers. \r\n~ You can bring AI versions of your other classes with you in a party. (I found adding 1 max is best)\r\n - PROs: Can get revived if downed AND they can finish off trash mobs for you. AND use their abilities\r\n - CONs: they only do about 1/8 of your total damage. AND enemies health is scaled higher.", "timestamp_created": 1788066721, "timestamp_updated": 1788066721, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "hardware": {"system_ram": "63092", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 7 9800X3D 8-Core Processor           ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080", "vram_size": 15977}, "reactions": []}]}